  "notes": "A megamenu is a large, horizontal menu where each item opens a popover to show a large block of navigation links. Megamenu must be used once, on top of the page. Inside each popover, you can use a daisyUI menu, or any custom content. Megamenu fits better on large screens only, and for small screens, you can hide the megamenu and show the content in a dropdown or a drawer.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/megamenu/+page.md",
  "code": "<div class=\"navbar bg-base-100 shadow-sm\">\n  <div class=\"navbar-start\">\n    <a class=\"btn btn-ghost text-xl\">daisyUI</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"navbar-center\">\n    <div class=\"megamenu max-sm:megamenu-vertical megamenu-full\" id=\"my-megamenu-4\" popover>\n      <span class=\"megamenu-active\"></span>\n      <button popovertarget=\"d1\">One</button>\n      <div id=\"d1\" popover>\n        <div class=\"flex max-sm:flex-col items-start\">\n          <ul class=\"menu w-full md:menu-horizontal\">\n            <li>\n              <a>Enterprise</a>\n              <ul>\n                <li><a>CRM software</a></li>\n                <li><a>Marketing management</a></li>\n                <li><a>Security</a></li>\n                <li><a>Consulting</a></li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <a>Company</a>\n              <ul>\n                <li><a>About us</a></li>\n                <li><a>Contact us</a></li>\n                <li><a>Privacy policy</a></li>\n                <li><a>Press kit</a></li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/stock/photo-1559181567-c3190ca9959b.webp\" class=\"md:max-w-sm max-md:hidden\" alt=\"Tailwind CSS megamenu\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <button popovertarget=\"d2\">Two</button>\n      <div id=\"d2\" popover>\n        <div class=\"flex max-sm:flex-col items-start\">\n          <ul class=\"menu w-full md:menu-horizontal\">\n            <li>\n              <a>Enterprise</a>\n              <ul>\n                <li><a>CRM software</a></li>\n                <li><a>Marketing management</a></li>\n                <li><a>Security</a></li>\n                <li><a>Consulting</a></li>\n                <li><a>Privacy policy</a></li>\n                <li><a>Press kit</a></li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <a>Products</a>\n              <ul>\n                <li><a>UI Kit</a></li>\n                <li><a>WordPress themes</a></li>\n                <li><a>WordPress plugins</a></li>\n                <li><a>Color picker app</a></li>\n                <li><a>About us</a></li>\n                <li><a>Contact us</a></li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/stock/photo-1572635148818-ef6fd45eb394.webp\" class=\"md:max-w-sm max-md:hidden\" alt=\"Tailwind CSS megamenu component\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <button popovertarget=\"d3\">Three</button>\n      <div id=\"d3\" popover>\n        <div class=\"flex max-sm:flex-col items-start\">\n          <ul class=\"menu w-full md:menu-horizontal\">\n            <li>\n              <a>Solutions</a>\n              <ul>\n                <li><a>Design</a></li>\n                <li><a>Development</a></li>\n                <li><a>Hosting</a></li>\n                <li><a>Domain register</a></li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <a>Products</a>\n              <ul>\n                <li><a>UI Kit</a></li>\n                <li>\n                  <a>Open source</a>\n                  <ul>\n                    <li><a>Auth management system</a></li>\n                    <li><a>VScode theme</a></li>\n                    <li><a>Color picker app</a></li>\n                  </ul>\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <a>Company</a>\n              <ul>\n                <li><a>About us</a></li>\n                <li><a>Contact us</a></li>\n                <li><a>Privacy policy</a></li>\n                <li><a>Press kit</a></li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"navbar-end\">\n    <a class=\"btn\">Login</a>\n    <button class=\"btn sm:hidden\" popovertarget=\"my-megamenu-4\">Menu</button>\n  </div>\n</div>",
